href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(p)=\\{z:p(z)&gt;0\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(p)=\\{z:p(z)&gt;0\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\le m}=\\bigcup_{j=0}^m\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\le m}=\\bigcup_{j=0}^m\\Sigma^j\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ens}(I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ens}(I)\\)</span> 是有限支撑分布族的集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ens}(I)\\coloneqq\\left\\{(X_i)_{i\\in I}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl[X_i\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Sigma^*)\\land\\exists m_i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{supp}(X_i)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{\\le m_i}\\bigr]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ens}(I)\\coloneqq\\left\\{(X_i)_{i\\in I}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl[X_i\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Sigma^*)\\land\\exists m_i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{supp}(X_i)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{\\le m_i}\\bigr]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是分布系综的本地接口；第 9 章按输入长度形成分布族。此定义本身不要求分布可高效采样，也不要求支撑长度对索引统一为多项式。密码学的效率和安全参数另由使用节点限定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$I$ 为非空可数索引集；$\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Sigma^*)$、$\\mathcal L$ 见 [[28-df-ppt]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Sigma^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(p)=\\{z:p(z)>0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{\\le m}=\\bigcup_{j=0}^m\\Sigma^j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ens}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ens}(I)\\coloneqq\\left\\{(X_i)_{i\\in I}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl[X_i\\in\\operatorname{Dist}(\\Sigma^*)\\land\\exists m_i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{supp}(X_i)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{\\le m_i}\\bigr]\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1268,"backlinks":[{"id":"71fe8c583a58e15f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal X=(X_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\\mathcal Y=(Y_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\operatorname{Ens}(\\mathbb N)$，见 [[28-df-ensemble]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"分布与视图：[[28-df-ensemble]]、[[28-df-view]]、[[28-df-statistical-distance]]、[[28-df-computational-indistinguishability]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75200f005282ddf"]}